       svrn mesh grant --all-apps --ttl 2h --url https://<origin>/ --qr-svg wall-qr.svg
       (--model may be omitted: it defaults to the daemon's primary slot)
  Serve it with gzip/brotli on (the wasm compresses well) and, if the
  host allows, the headers index.html's meta tags ask for — a CDN gives
  both; nothing here depends on them.
